# isready is prompt during search but acknowledges an earlier ordered barrier.
@phase 4.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< ucinewgame
< isready
> readyok
< position startpos
< go infinite searchmoves e2e4
! allow-info begin
< isready
> readyok
< position startpos moves d2d4
> bestmove e2e4{{PONDER}}
! allow-info end
< isready
> readyok
< go nodes 1 searchmoves d7d5
! allow-info begin
> bestmove d7d5
! allow-info end
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
